#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Annual impact metrics:</b> Review aggregated charts giving your board of\n"
"                directors clear evidence of your social footprint:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Metrik dampak tahunan:</b> Tinjau grafik agregat yang memberikan bukti "
"jelas kepada dewan\n"
"                direksi mengenai jejak sosial:"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Calendar:</b> Organize medical appointments and family visits with automated\n"
"                reminders for the entire team."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kalender:</b> Atur appointment medis dan kunjungan keluarga dengan\n"
"                pengingat otomatis untuk seluruh tim."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Contacts:</b> Securely manage residents, guardians, and medical networks in a\n"
"                centralized, categorized database."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kontak:</b> Kelola data penghuni, wali, dan jaringan medis secara aman "
"dalam\n"
"                database yang terpusat dan terkategorisasi."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Daily Liaison Logs:</b> Use Knowledge Articles to record anecdotes and shift\n"
"                handovers. This ensures that the night shift knows exactly what happened during the\n"
"                day."
msgstr ""
"<b>Catatan Koordinasi Harian:</b> Gunakan Artikel Pengetahuan untuk mencatat "
"anekdot dan\n"
"                serah terima shift. Dengan begitu, shift malam dapat "
"mengetahui hal-hal yang terjadi selama\n"
"                shift siang."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Documents:</b> Store sensitive legal orders, school reports, and care plans in a\n"
"                secure, searchable location."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dokumen:</b> Simpan dokumen-dokumen hukum yang sensitif, laporan sekolah, "
"dan rencana perawatan di\n"
"                lokasi yang aman dan mudah dicari."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employee Records:</b> Store mandatory certifications and training records in the\n"
"                Employees App to ensure compliance with local care regulations."
msgstr ""
"<b>Record Karyawan:</b> Simpan sertifikat wajib dan catatan pelatihan di\n"
"                Aplikasi Karyawan untuk memastikan kepatuhan terhadap "
"peraturan perawatan setempat."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employees:</b> Manage staff certifications and hierarchies to ensure the most\n"
"                qualified team is always on-site."
msgstr ""
"<b>Karyawan:</b> Kelola sertifikasi dan hierarki staf untuk memastikan\n"
"                tim yang paling mumpuni selalu ada di lokasi."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Interactive Audit Mode:</b> Access the underlying Spreadsheet behind the\n"
"                    dashboard to switch from \"Automatic\" to \"Manual\" mode. Input any historical\n"
"                    dates to recalculate the entire report instantly. This is perfect for answering\n"
"                    retro-active funding disputes or state audits from 6 months ago."
msgstr ""
"<b>Mode Audit Interaktif:</b> Akses spreadsheet penting yang mendasari\n"
"                    data di dashboard untuk beralih dari mode \"Otomatis\" "
"ke \"Manual\". Masukkan tanggal historis\n"
"                    untuk menghitung ulang seluruh laporan secara instan. "
"Fitur ini sangat cocok untuk menjawab\n"
"                    sengketa pendanaan retroaktif atau audit negara bagian "
"dari 6 bulan lalu."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoicing App:</b> Create and issue receipts or monthly invoices directly to\n"
"                residents based on their actual overnight stays, simplifying front-desk collections\n"
"                and cash management."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Faktur:</b> Buat dan terbitkan bukti pembayaran atau faktur "
"bulanan langsung kepada\n"
"                penghuni berdasarkan jumlah malam menginap aktual untuk "
"menyederhanakan proses penagihan di resepsionis\n"
"                dan pengelolaan kas."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Knowledge:</b> Draft collaborative observation logs and formal reports using\n"
"                standardized, professional templates."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengetahuan:</b> Susun catatan observasi kolaboratif dan laporan formal "
"menggunakan\n"
"                template standar dan profesional."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Leverage Color Tags:</b> Use bright colors for Allergies and Medication\n"
"                        alerts. This visual cue is the fastest way to prevent errors during meal\n"
"                        times or activities."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manfaatkan Tag Warna:</b> Gunakan warna-warna cerah untuk peringatan "
"Alergi dan Obat.\n"
"                        Petunjuk visual ini adalah cara tercepat untuk "
"mencegah kesalahan selama waktu makan\n"
"                        atau kegiatan."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Maintenance</b> – Track repairs for the facility and safety equipment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Maintenance</b> – Pantau perbaikan untuk fasilitas dan peralatan "
"keselamatan."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Meeting Focus:</b> Utilize the Smart Button on the Resident profile to jump\n"
"                directly to meeting notes that focus on that specific individual."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fokus Rapat:</b> Gunakan Tombol Pintar pada profil Residen untuk "
"langsung\n"
"                membuka catatan rapat yang berfokus pada individu tersebut."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Mentorship Planning:</b> Document long-term \"Life Paths\" and collaborative goals\n"
"                between mentors and residents, tracking progress through the Project App."
msgstr ""
"<b>Perencanaan Bimbingan:</b> Dokumentasikan \"Jalur Hidup\" jangka panjang "
"dan target kolaboratif\n"
"                antara mentor dan peserta program, serta lacak kemajuan "
"melalui Aplikasi Project."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Monthly overnights:</b> Automatically generate nominative lists of overnight\n"
"                stays for the previous month. The built-in mathematical engine handles ongoing stays\n"
"                (empty departure dates) flawlessly, eliminating manual night-by-night counting."
msgstr ""
"<b>Periode menginap bulanan:</b> Secara otomatis menghasilkan daftar "
"nominatif menginap\n"
"                untuk bulan sebelumnya. Mesin matematika bawaan menangani "
"masa menginap yang masih berlangsung\n"
"                (tanggal keluar kosong) dengan sempurna, menghilangkan "
"kebutuhan akan penghitungan manual per malam."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Nightly Resident Contribution:</b> Utilize a dedicated service product pre-set to\n"
"                your symbolic rate to automate line-item generation and eliminate manual pricing\n"
"                errors."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kontribusi Penghuni Malam:</b> Manfaatkan preset produk layanan khusus "
"sesuai\n"
"                tarif simbolis untuk mengotomatiskan pembuatan item baris "
"dan menghilangkan kesalahan penetapan harga\n"
"                manual."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Planning App:</b> Utilize the Gantt View to visualize 24/7 coverage. Create\n"
"                templates for recurring shifts to save hours on weekly scheduling."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Perencanaan:</b> Manfaatkan Tampilan Gantt untuk "
"memvisualisasikan cakupan 24/7. Buat\n"
"                template untuk shift berulang guna menghemat waktu saat "
"melakukan penjadwalan mingguan."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Planning:</b> Coordinate 24/7 staff coverage to ensure safety ratios and\n"
"                consistent caregiver presence."
msgstr ""
"<b>Perencanaan:</b> Koordinasikan staf 24/7 untuk memastikan rasio "
"keselamatan dan\n"
"                kehadiran pengasuh yang konsisten."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project:</b> Track long-term developmental milestones and facility maintenance\n"
"                tasks through organized stages."
msgstr ""
"<b>Project:</b> Lacak milestone perkembangan jangka panjang dan tugas "
"maintenance fasilitas\n"
"                melalui tahapan yang tersusun rapi."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Related data:</b> Leverage the smart buttons from residents to reach their\n"
"                Documents and notes efficiently."
msgstr ""
"<b>Data terkait:</b> Manfaatkan tombol pintar dari penghuni untuk mengakses\n"
"                Dokumen dan catatan mereka secara efisien."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Relationship mapping:</b> Link resident's family unit, precise in charge social\n"
"                workers, general practitioner and more contacts to create a 360-degree care circle."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pemetaan hubungan:</b> Hubungkan unit keluarga penghuni, petugas sosial "
"yang bertanggung jawab secara spesifik,\n"
"                dokter umum, dan kontak lainnya untuk menciptakan lingkaran "
"perawatan 360 derajat."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Residents App:</b> A specialized workspace to manage the placement lifecycle from\n"
"                admission to successful transition."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Penghuni:</b> Ruang kerja khusus untuk mengelola siklus "
"penempatan mulai dari\n"
"                penerimaan hingga transisi yang berhasil."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Residents app:</b> Use the dedicated dashboard to view your current "
"residents."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikasi Penghuni:</b> Gunakan dashboard khusus untuk melihat daftar "
"penghuni Anda saat ini."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Secure Your Folders:</b> Regularly audit the Documents App folder\n"
"                        permissions to ensure that sensitive legal data is only accessible to\n"
"                        authorized \"Need to Know\" staff."
msgstr ""
"<b>Amankan Folder:</b> Lakukan audit rutin terhadap izin folder Aplikasi "
"Dokumen\n"
"                        untuk memastikan bahwa data hukum yang sensitif "
"hanya dapat diakses oleh\n"
"                        staf yang berwenang dan yang \"Perlu Tahu\"."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Shortcuts:</b> Capture shortcut pattern from the Residents App configuration menu\n"
"            and list shortcuts using residents'ids on every portal you frequently go to."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pintasan:</b> Ambil pola pintasan dari menu konfigurasi Aplikasi "
"Penghuni\n"
"            dan cantumkan pintasan menggunakan ID penghuni di setiap portal "
"yang sering dikunjungi."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Specialized profiles:</b> Capture unique data like Nicknames, Primary Languages,\n"
"                and Date of Birth to provide personalized, trauma-informed care."
msgstr ""
"<b>Profil khusus:</b> Kumpulkan data unik seperti Nama Panggilan, Bahasa "
"Utama,\n"
"                dan Tanggal Lahir untuk memberikan perawatan khusus yang "
"sesuai dengan trauma penghuni."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardize Handovers:</b> Encourage all staff to use a specific\n"
"                        Knowledge Template for shift handovers. Consistency in documentation leads\n"
"                        to better continuity of care."
msgstr ""
"<b>Standarisasi Serah Terima:</b> Anjurkan seluruh staf untuk menggunakan\n"
"                        Template Pengetahuan tertentu untuk serah terima "
"shift. Konsistensi dalam dokumentasi akan\n"
"                        menghasilkan kesinambungan perawatan yang lebih baik."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardized Templates:</b> Create \"Report Ready\" articles for School Reports or\n"
"                Life Goal Plans, significantly reducing the time spent on formal correspondence."
msgstr ""
"<b>Template Standar:</b> Buat artikel \"Siap Dilaporkan\" untuk Laporan "
"Sekolah atau\n"
"                Rencana Tujuan Hidup, sehingga secara signifikan mengurangi "
"waktu yang dihabiskan untuk korespondensi formal."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Subsidy segregation:</b> Route all revenue from resident participations to a\n"
"                distinct income account in your chart of accounts, completely isolating\n"
"                micro-revenues from state subsidies, public grants, and philanthropic funds."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pemisahan subsidi:</b> Arahkan seluruh pendapatan dari partisipasi warga "
"ke\n"
"                rekening pendapatan terpisah dalam bagan akun agar "
"pendapatan mikro\n"
"                 dari subsidi negara, hibah publik, dan dana filantropi "
"dapat terpisah sepenuhnya."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Tax-exempt configuration:</b> Apply a 0% tax or \"Exempt\" status to your\n"
"                contribution product by default, ensuring full compliance with non-profit legal\n"
"                frameworks without contaminating commercial sales tax workflows."
msgstr ""
"<b>Konfigurasi bebas pajak:</b> Terapkan pajak 0% atau status \"Bebas "
"Pajak\" pada\n"
"                produk kontribusi secara default, memastikan kepatuhan penuh "
"terhadap kerangka hukum\n"
"                nirlaba tanpa mengganggu alur kerja pajak penjualan "
"komersial."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Time Off Management:</b> Automatically sync staff absences with the Planning App\n"
"                to identify coverage gaps before they become safety risks."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manajemen Cuti:</b> Sinkronkan ketidakhadiran staf secara otomatis dengan "
"Aplikasi Perencanaan\n"
"                untuk mengidentifikasi celah penugasan sebelum menjadi "
"risiko keselamatan."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Time Off:</b> Handle leave requests seamlessly without compromising critical\n"
"                caregiver-to-resident safety ratios."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cuti:</b> Tangani permintaan cuti dengan lancar tanpa mengorbankan\n"
"                rasio keselamatan yang kritis antara pengasuh dan penghuni."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timesheets:</b> Log specific care hours and administrative tasks for accurate\n"
"                facility operational reporting."
msgstr ""
"<b>Timesheet:</b> Catat jam perawatan spesifik dan tugas administratif "
"untuk\n"
"                pelaporan operasional fasilitas yang akurat."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timesheets:</b> Staff can log hours against specific care activities, providing\n"
"                management with clear data on administrative vs. direct-care time."
msgstr ""
"<b>Timesheet:</b> Staf dapat mencatat jam kerja berdasarkan aktivitas "
"perawatan tertentu, sehingga\n"
"                manajemen mendapatkan data yang jelas mengenai waktu "
"administratif versus waktu perawatan langsung."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Use the Kanban Grouping:</b> Group your Residents App by age or legal\n"
"                        status to get an instant bird's-eye view of your facility's demographic and\n"
"                        legal landscape."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gunakan Pengelompokan Kanban:</b> Kelompokkan Aplikasi Penghuni Anda "
"berdasarkan usia atau status hukum\n"
"                        untuk mendapatkan gambaran menyeluruh secara instan "
"mengenai demografi dan\n"
"                        lanskap hukum fasilitas Anda."

