#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With millions of residents in small facilities globally, the need for a secure,\n"
"            integrated system has never been higher. This package leverages Odoo's powerful core\n"
"            modules to transform how small homes manage staff, legal records, and daily care.\n"
"            Ultimately, we are giving care teams the tools to refocus on their true mission: <b>providing\n"
"            a safe, supportive environment for every resident, not just managing clicks.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Dengan jutaan penghuni di fasilitas-fasilitas kecil di seluruh dunia, "
"kebutuhan akan sistem yang aman dan\n"
"            terintegrasi belum pernah setinggi ini. Paket ini memanfaatkan "
"modul inti Odoo yang kuat\n"
"            untuk mengubah cara panti kecil mengelola staf, catatan hukum, "
"dan perawatan sehari-hari.\n"
"            Pada akhirnya, kami memberikan alat kepada tim pengasuhan agar "
"dapat kembali fokus pada misi sejati mereka: <b>menyediakan\n"
"            lingkungan yang aman dan mendukung bagi setiap penghuni, bukan "
"sekadar mengelola klik.</b>"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah Anda ingin mendiskusikan lebih lanjut setup Odoo Anda dengan kami "
"atau melanjutkan tur?"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt your\n"
"                    Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"Anda berhasil menyelesaikan contoh demo kasus penggunaan ini! Ada banyak "
"cara untuk menyesuaikan\n"
"                    pengaturan Odoo agar sesuai dengan kebutuhan bisnis Anda."

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
